e. We can't count the enemies without scrolling through all 100, but the number 100 being round suggests 93 enemies + 7 bosses = 100 total. Plausible. So not a bug.\n\nLet me check whether the \"All\" filter on the Bosses tab shows all 7 (yes) and the progress is shared. I'll leave it.\n\nNow, the \"Missing\" filter on Bosses with 0 encountered shows all 7 (same as All). Fine.\n\nOK, now let's test the Quest board quickly. Bottom Quests tab (element 41? Actually bottom nav Quests at (760,2169) element 41). Tap."}
