now.\n\nThe change note \"available quests are now refreshed from the character state each time the board opens\" suggests the bug might be that quests that should be available (based on character state) are missing or stale. Since all these II quests appear dim, maybe they're locked for another reason (e.g., you must be level X). We can check the Weekly tab or Crafting Skills.\n\nGiven the scope, I'll note it but not report (can't determine expected).\n\nActually wait: The grayed-out quests might be \"locked\" due to \"Hide completed\" state? No, Hide completed is off. Hmm.\n\nLet me look at the Crafting Skills tab: Smithing I completed; Smithing II maybe grayed. And Combat tab maybe has \"Goblin Slayer\" etc. Let's peek. Tap Crafting Skills (element 3)."}
