{"type": "thinking", "text": "Back to normal portrait Home. \n\nNow, is there anything else in the shop worth checking? The buy quantity \"Max\" and total. Let's test a buy with quantity 60 (Magic Logs?) or buy Logs 60 → total 420. Actually, we have 2.5M coins, so max for Logs is huge (367k). Hmm, \"Max\" would set a huge number (367k) and total = 2.57M? Wait, buy price 7, coins 2,568,357 → max 366,908. Buying Max would spend all coins — don't confirm; just inspect. Could reveal a max quantity bug (e.g., Max not accounting discount). But the item buy price has a strike-through discount (7 current, 10 original). The Max should use current price. We can tap Max in the Buy Logs dialog and read total; verify total = max × 7? Not exact coins known (2.5M abbreviated), so we can't compute exact. Skip.\n\nWhat about the \"2× XP Boost\" showing \"1.8M coins\" but original \"2.5M coins\" — a 28% discount. Fine.\n\nCheck the Sell list \"Price\" sort descending — good. \"Quantity\" sort descending — good. \"Default\" alphabetical within sections — good.\n\nNow, one thing I haven't verified: the Shop Sell list \"Default\" sort's section order: WEAPONS, ARMOR, TOOLS, MATERIALS, MISC... In the All list, sections appear. Fine.\n\nWhat about the purchase of an equipment item (Basic Staff) — it would be added to inventory and show in the Gear/weapon chooser. Not necessary.\n\nI think it's time to sign off. But before that, let me consider the \"gear and equipment\" area for the \"Best gear\" button bug potential: We saw \"Equip Best Gear\" equipped Steel Full Helmet as Head (Def +16), while Mithril Med Helmet also Def +16. Which is \"better\"? They're equal in Def, but maybe the Mithril has a higher unlock (30) and the app picked the lower-tier Steel. If \"best\" is by Def only, a tie can pick either. Fine.\n\nFor Cape: Agility (XP +10%) vs Mercantile (Yield +10%) — picked Agility. Fine.\n\nWeapon: Iron Sword (Atk +10, Str +9) is the only weapon. Fine.\n\nBody: Gilded +95 is the best