{"type": "text", "text": "I completed the QA sweep and signed off.\n\n**Summary**\n\n- **Shop** — Tested Buy/Sell, search, filters, sorts, \"Keep one of each item\" (including state persistence), Sell Junk and Sell Old Gear previews vs actual payouts, per-item trade-in quantities/input bounds, and Recent bulk sales.\n  - **Confirmed bug:** with the keeper toggle ON, the per-item trade-in panel double-subtracts the equipped copy — Iron Sword offered only 1 (62 coins) while Sell Old Gear offered 2 (124), and Bronze Axe was refused with the misleading \"Bronze Axe is equipped. Unequip it first to sell.\" despite a spare copy. Logged with the developer.\n- **Gear & equipment** — Verified gathering tools, slot chooser ordering (unlock threshold ascending, alphabetical tiebreak), equip/unequip, persistence, stat recalculation, Equip Best Gear/Tools, and per-style loadouts.\n- **Bestiary** — Verified Enemies/Bosses tabs, All/Missing filters, A–Z/By Location sorting, multi-location grouping, and creature detail sheets.\n\nTwo landscape layout cut-off issues (Combat Gear, Home) were reported, but the developer could not reproduce either, so they remain unconfirmed. All test data was restored to the starting state (equipment, loadouts, keeper toggle, Logs count) apart from the unavoidable junk bulk-sale reductions."}
